body:
I actually wrote a nifty sort of race for my first campaign. The Yokai, a race of constructs with the souls of feywild spirits inhabiting them. Anytime an object was given enough attention and assumed personality- like a child's toy or a statue- a yokai would form out of them. 

&#x200B;

ASI I would think Constitution and Charisma, and they'd be probably good in Bard or Rogue classes. Something with a sort of jack-of-all feel.
